    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "United\nAir Lines\nSan Francisco,\nOakland\n\u0026 San Jose\nUnited\nEffective October 26, 1969",
      "My the\nfriendly skies\nof\nUnited.\nNOVEMBER-1969\nS\nM TW T\nF\n2\n9\n16\n23\n10\n17\n24\n4\n11\n18\n25\n5\n12\n19\n26\nS\n1\n7\n8\n13\n14\n15\n20\n21\n22\n27\n28\n29\nS\nDECEMBER-1969\nT\nT\n2\n7\n14\n21\n28\nM\n1\n8\n15\n22\n29\n16\n23\n30\n3\n10\n17\n24\n31\n4\n11\n18\n25\nF\n5\n12\n19\n26\nS\n6\n13\n20\n27\n30\nDiscover America and Family Plan fares not applicable\nfrom 12:01 p.m. - 11:59\np.m. Friday nor from 12:01 p.m.\nSunday to 11:59 a.m. Monday (shaded areas on calendar).\nFor travel to/from Canada or Hawaii\nand\nfor restricted\ntravel days, contact United or your travel agent for details.\nSan Francisco.\n397-2100\nOakland\n834-5600\nSan Jose.\n246-5400\nFor additional telephone service, see listings inside.\nPrinted in U.S.A.\nReturn Postage Guaranteed\nUnited Air Lines\nP.O. Box 66100\nChicago, 111.60666\n6 / 69",
      "HONOLULU\nVANCOUVER. B.C.\nSEATTLE-TACOM\nPORTLAN\nPENDLETON\nEUGENE\nBOISE\nMEDFORD\nELKO\nSALT LAKE CITY\nSAN FRANCISCO\nOAKLAND\nSANE\nMONTEREY-\nSALINAS\nRENO\nELY\nACRAMENTO\nSTOCKTON\nMODESTO\nMERCED\nFRESNO\nVISALIA\nBAKERSFIELD\n/LASHEGAS\nGRAND JUNCTION\nSANTA BARBARA\nSAN DIEGO\nHILE\nTRANSCONTINENTAL NONSTOP JET SERVICE\nSEATTLE/TACOMA\nPORTLAND\nSAN FRANCISCO/OAKLAND/SAN JOSE\nLOS ANGELES\nHONOLULU C\n\u003e HILO\nCHICAG\nBUS ON\n•HARTFORD SPRINGFIELI\n-NEW YORK/NEWARK\nPHILADELPHIA\nBALTIMORE/WASHINGTON, D.C.\n• MEMPHIS\nANTONI\nBIRMINGHAM\nMINNEAPOLIS-ST. PAUL\nDES MOINES\n• OMAHA\n**\nDISCOVER AMERICA\nSAGINAW-BAY CITY MIDLAND\nTORONTO\nMUSKEGON\nBOSTON\nROCHESTER HARTFORD-SPRINGFIELD\nMiLWAUKEE\nBUFFALO\nPROVIDENCE\nDETROTT\nCLEVELAI\nEW YORK\nTOLEDO\nOUTH PEND TO CAN YOL\nYOUNGSTOWN-WARREN\nNEWARK\nSHARON ALLENTONY-BETHLEHEM-EASTON\nPITTSBU\nPHILADELPHIA\nMOLIN!\nROCK ISLAND\nDAVENPORT\n-FORT WAYNE\nI DAYION COLUMBOS\nCHARLESTON/ W. VA\nALTIMORE-WASHINGTON\nNEWPORT NEWS-HAMPTON\nWHAMSKUKE\nRICHMOND\nNORFOLK-PORTSMOUTH\nBRISTOL-KINGSPORT-JOHNSON CIT\nGREENSBORO-HIGH POINT-\nWINSTON-SALEM\nRALEIGH-DURHAM\nKNOXVILLE\nCHATTANOOGA\n/ASHEVILLE /\nCHARLOTTE\nMEMPHIS\nNTA\nBIRMINGHAM\nMOBILE\nJACKSONVILLE\nNEW ORLEANS\nTAMPA\nST. PETERSBURG-\nMIAMI-\nFORT LAUDERDALE\nGive your wife Hawaii\nfor Christmas...\ngo any time next year\nThis year, give your wife (and yourself a Christmas gift to\nremember forever.\nTwo tickets on a United Air Lines' flight to our exotic 50th\nState ... Hawaii... a paradise of dreams and rainbows that\nnever end.\nA gift you can give her at Christmas and take anytime next\nyear. And you can charge everything with a tree United\nPersonal Travel Credit Card. Call United, or visit your Travel\nAgent-the trained professional who has all the answers to\nyour questions about hotels and things to do.\nHawaii for Christmas. Imagine. April in Hawaii. Or May.\nOr whenever it's convenient.\nfly the friendly skies of United"
